    "body": "Yea I think this is a dup of #11429.\n\nSome paper trail:\nhttps://github.com/w3c/DOM-Parsing/issues/24\n\nSeems like originally we didn't think of this as observable, but it is using `document.domain` and `document.open()`, so let's spec implemented reality (it matches the origin of the document that created it, or some such).\n",
